      <div class="mb-4">
        <h3>From Malta to Gozo</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><p><strong>Gozo Ferry</strong>: A 15-minute ferry from Ċirkewwa (Malta) to Mġarr Harbour (Gozo). The ferry to Gozo's Mġarr Harbour leaves every 30-45 minutes. Be sure to <a class="link" href="https://www.gozochannel.com/ferry/schedule/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the Gozo Channel Schedule</a>.</p></li>
            <li><p><strong>Fast Ferry</strong>: A 45-minute passenger ferry from Valletta (Malta) to Gozo. <a class="link" href="https://gozohighspeed.com/pages/fares-and-schedule" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the Fast Ferry Schedule</a>. Please note that in case of bad weather, the fast ferry may not operate. It's always a good idea to check their <a href="https://www.facebook.com/GozoHighspeed" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook page</a> for the latest updates.</p></li>
        </ul>

        <h3>From Mġarr Harbour (Gozo) to Xlendi</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><p><strong>Direct Bus</strong>: The TD30 bus goes directly from the harbour to Xlendi, running every 30 minutes on weekdays.</p></li>
            <li><p><strong>Connecting Buses</strong>: Alternatively, take bus 301 to Victoria (Rabat), then switch to bus 306 to reach Xlendi.</p></li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Airport Transfer</h4>
        <p>We can arrange a taxi transfer from Malta International Airport directly to the apartment. Please <a class="link" href="/contact">contact us</a> to schedule.</p>
